  "verified": [
    "The original SimpleFirstLeftRight package round-trips all six variants with their original OOXML part types, relationships and section flags.",
    "The original headerfooter-link-to-prev package retains the selected first, even and default header and footer paragraphs in three independently owned section styles after repeat import.",
    "The original tdf135216_evenOddFooter package retains the model-facing left and first footer values in alternate parity page styles.",
    "Footer tables are native section children. Linked and parity copies are independent and retain text and nested table order.",
    "The original NumberedList package opens on existing Writer UI, restores from browser storage, downloads ODT and DOCX, and reopens downloaded DOCX at mobile width.",
    "Source decimal-zero numbering identifiers and ordinary built-in Footer pool ownership survive Writer primary ODT. ODF automatic table styles are scoped to their XML stream."
  ],
